  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-beta.3.1 wrapping ZVec C++ 0.5.1. Standard Apache-2.0 LICENSE text. SHA-bound Publish (Pack artifacts must match tag commit). Local Pack-parity sim mandatory before remote Pack. Consumer HardExit after Shutdown. OpenOrCreate + Linux Auto teardown (#619). Shipped natives: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, android-arm64, android-x64. See README Native RIDs and CHANGELOG.",
